ayer sandbox where players terraform voxel worlds, build structures, and share custom verses via Steam Workshop. Set in customizable garages and expansive landscapes, it blends vehicle physics, character switching, and drone flight for collaborative world-building. Core mechanics include VerseGate for real-time world control\u2014weather, time, spawns\u2014and runtime asset imports for models, textures, and sounds.\nSpecial features include Unreal Engine 5.6.1 source with headless server support, Mutable MetaHumans for character customization, real-time speech recognition, and integrated tools like car customizers, jump pads, and foliage systems. Players host or join sessions to raise continents, experiment with biomes, and iterate on shared creations without restarts.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/digital-creative-framework"}